{"id":"n69484-1-8","stage":1,"title":"반대 · 反","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69484-1-8-1","ko":"너랑 너희 언니랑 분위기가 정말 다르네?","zh":"你和你姐姐的氛围真的完全不一样呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너랑","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너랑","audio":"/audio/32c7250ffa53acbc7ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"언니랑","meaning":"姐姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"1","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언니랑","audio":"/audio/7e0f21dbe0cf44ab109f.mp3"}},{"text":"분위기가","meaning":"气质，格调，情调","explanation":"분위기：气质，格调，情调；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분위기","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65855","senseId":"3","lemma":"분위기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분위기가","audio":"/audio/aeafae1134479b98bf89.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"다르네?","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다르네","audio":"/audio/4160621aeb06d21f0ac8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"b0d7b29bb8fee646","term":"분위기","zh":"气质，格调，情调","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3","entryId":"65855","definition":"某人或某物散发出的独特感觉。","pronunciation":["부뉘기"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"不同，不一致","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8e72cf434a241a9624c0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69484-1-8-2","ko":"언니는 나랑 외모부터 옷 고르는 취향까지 완전히 반대야.","zh":"我姐姐无论外貌还是选衣服的品味，都和我完全相反。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언니는","meaning":"姐姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"1","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언니는","audio":"/audio/577311129f79563d5ae1.mp3"}},{"text":"나랑","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나랑","audio":"/audio/ba7570f9b8a80f0e0d15.mp3"}},{"text":"외모부터","meaning":"外貌，外表","explanation":"외모：外貌，外表；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"외모","audio":"/audio/2b872bd16206aa00739f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22154","senseId":"1","lemma":"외모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외모부터","audio":"/audio/60fd8e382f7024fdd0a4.mp3"}},{"text":"옷","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}},{"text":"고르는","meaning":"挑选","explanation":"고르다：挑选；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"고르다","audio":"/audio/68f72f1020d14395ff22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19935","senseId":"1","lemma":"고르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고르는","audio":"/audio/6b06ee95e29c096b2f74.mp3"}},{"text":"취향까지","meaning":"品味，口味","explanation":"취향：品味，口味；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"취향","audio":"/audio/9233b549ae393a1d5d68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27862","senseId":"1","lemma":"취향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"취향까지","audio":"/audio/e1cb7628411b776c4516.mp3"}},{"text":"완전히","meaning":"完全地，完美地，彻底地","explanation":"완전히：完全地，完美地，彻底地","readings":[{"term":"완전히","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67847","senseId":"1","lemma":"완전히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"완전히","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3"}},{"text":"반대야.","meaning":"反，相反","explanation":"반대：反，相反；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"반대","audio":"/audio/8b41caa49fef042da7ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69484","senseId":"1","lemma":"반대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반대야","audio":"/audio/7c62dc136eb5c90d36a4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或